            "<p>Licensed firms in a country with an ombudsman or a usable court are a different problem from an unlicensed site. With a real firm you may have a complaint scheme, a limitation period, and a contract clause on venue. With a shell you may have a strong story and nowhere to collect. The consultation is free precisely so that feasibility can be tested against proof before anyone talks about filing.</p>"
